# Issue #2970 (phase 3, upload times): each document attribution range gains
# `createdAt` and `signedAt`. Both page variants of the ranges response embed
# the range, and oasdiff matches the inline `anyOf` variants by content, so it
# reports the two changed variants as two added ones. No variant was added and
# no property was removed or retyped: the response only gained two required
# properties. Remove this whole file as soon as main contains the new contract.
GET /documents/{documentId}/attribution/ranges added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the response body `anyOf` list for the response status `200`
